WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.133 --> 00:00:02.601
-Multiple co-defendants

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.367
in one of Donald Trump's
criminal cases

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:06.701
have now flipped on him
by pleading guilty

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:08.100
and agreeing
to testify against him,

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.300
including his former lawyer,
Sidney Powell,

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.234
who Trump is now claiming
was never actually his lawyer,

00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:14.901
despite the fact
that he said at the time

00:00:14.901 --> 00:00:16.234
Sidney Powell was his lawyer.

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:19.667
For more on this,
it's time for A Closer Look.

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:23.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.901
As horrifying as it may be,
the reality is that Donald Trump

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:28.634
is currently the far
and away front runner

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:31.133
for the GOP nomination
for president in 2024.

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:33.801
What does far and away mean?
Well, he's ahead by roughly

00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:35.934
21 points
in the current FiveThirtyEight

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:39.601
polling average against
every other candidate combined.

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:44.000
If you Voltron the GOP field
into one super candidate,

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.601
it would not be within shouting
distance of Donald Trump,

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:50.133
a man with the largest
shouting radius in America.

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.100
What's that?
If you Voltron the GOP field,

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.868
what body parts would you
take from each candidate?

00:00:53.868 --> 00:00:55.767
It's obvious.
Mike Pence's "I'm concerned,

00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:57.467
but not enough to do anything"
face,

00:00:57.467 --> 00:01:01.200
Ron DeSantis'
pudding-scooping fingers,

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.734
and Doug Burgum's
glass eye.

00:01:02.734 --> 00:01:04.868
Did you know Doug Burgum
has a glass eye?

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:08.167
He doesn't, but I didn't
know anything about him,

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:09.634
so I made it up.
Before today,

00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:11.534
I didn't even know he was
the governor of South Dakota,

00:01:11.534 --> 00:01:15.868
which is okay, because he's
the governor of North Dakota.

00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:19.000
But Trump, the biggest front
runner who has ever run front,

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.100
has just been hit
with more bad legal news.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:23.467
Another one of his co-defendants
just flipped on him.

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:24.767
-In a surprise move,

00:01:24.767 --> 00:01:27.267
former Trump attorney
Kenneth Chesebro pled guilty

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:30.133
to a felony in the Georgia
election interference case

00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:33.000
and accepted a plea deal
with prosecutors.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.367
The Harvard-educated lawyer

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:37.000
has seen quite a fall
in the last few years.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.968
Considered the legal architect
of the plan

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:41.868
to use fake electors
to steal the election,

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:45.634
Chesebro now faces 100 hours
of community service,

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:46.901
five years probation,

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:50.667
a $5,000 fine,
and perhaps most importantly,

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:53.300
he will testify against
the other co-defendants,

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.200
including Donald Trump.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:56.767
-You know how I know
this is bad for Trump?

00:01:56.767 --> 00:01:58.067
I don't remember
who this guy is.

00:01:58.067 --> 00:01:59.467
When I first saw his photo,

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:02.934
I thought it was
Montana Governor Doug Burgum.

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:05.267
Because you see, when nutballs
like Rudy Giuliani

00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:06.501
and Mike Lindell
get in trouble,

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:07.968
it just feels like
that's part of the plan.

00:02:07.968 --> 00:02:09.367
It's been factored in.

00:02:09.367 --> 00:02:12.267
But when an anonymous white
collar Harvard guy goes down

00:02:12.267 --> 00:02:14.033
and says he'll cooperate
with prosecutors,

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:16.667
that's got to be when Trump is
thinking to himself, "Oh, no."

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:18.801
Because if Mike Lindell
or Rudy Giuliani

00:02:18.801 --> 00:02:20.667
ever flipped on Trump
and told a jury

00:02:20.667 --> 00:02:22.567
Trump was guilty,
Trump would be found innocent

00:02:22.567 --> 00:02:26.334
by the first lunch break,
because they're [bleep] nuts.

00:02:26.334 --> 00:02:28.367
I kind of think that was
the whole game plan.

00:02:28.367 --> 00:02:31.200
Let those two hair-dye-addicted
clowns scream

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.968
and cry on TV while the quiet,
buttoned up

00:02:33.968 --> 00:02:36.267
Harvard guy does all
the real crying for you.

00:02:36.267 --> 00:02:38.501
But these buttoned up
quiet type --

00:02:38.501 --> 00:02:40.100
the Chesebros, if you will --

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:42.534
are the ones who actually
understand what went down.

00:02:42.534 --> 00:02:44.067
He's a Harvard-educated lawyer

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:45.701
with a long history
in Washington politics,

00:02:45.701 --> 00:02:48.267
who might actually be able
to explain to a jury

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:50.534
where the bodies are buried,
as opposed to Rudy,

00:02:50.534 --> 00:02:54.868
who looks like a guy who knows
the best places to dig one up.

00:02:54.868 --> 00:02:57.133
[As Giuliani] "I look for
tombstones with fancy names.

00:02:57.133 --> 00:03:00.701
They're most likely
to be wearing watches."

00:03:00.701 --> 00:03:03.601
[Normally] Before we move on,
a lot of time was spent today

00:03:03.601 --> 00:03:05.400
on making a joke
about how Chesebro

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:08.801
sounds like a line of
cheese-based Hasbro products.

00:03:11.601 --> 00:03:13.734
But it was decided that had
nothing to do

00:03:13.734 --> 00:03:16.934
with this very important news
story, so we abandoned that.

00:03:16.934 --> 00:03:18.667
We didn't want to waste
your time by showing you

00:03:18.667 --> 00:03:19.834
what products they would make.

00:03:19.834 --> 00:03:23.667
Products like Barbrie.

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:27.434
Or My Little Provolony.

00:03:27.434 --> 00:03:31.000
We're better than that.
We're better than that.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:34.200
And more importantly,
you're better than that.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.701
And this plea deal came one day

00:03:35.701 --> 00:03:37.501
after another plea deal
that was bad for Trump.

00:03:37.501 --> 00:03:39.734
Last week, we told you that
former Trump lawyer

00:03:39.734 --> 00:03:41.501
Sidney Powell
pleaded guilty and agreed

00:03:41.501 --> 00:03:42.834
to cooperate with prosecutors

00:03:42.834 --> 00:03:44.467
in their investigation
of Trump's attempt to overturn

00:03:44.467 --> 00:03:45.968
the 2020 election
results in Georgia.

00:03:45.968 --> 00:03:48.734
You might recall Powell
from this recent mugshot,

00:03:48.734 --> 00:03:52.100
where she looks like she just
saw the videotape from the ring

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:54.767
and she was on it.

00:03:54.767 --> 00:04:00.968
[As Powell] "Hello. Seven days?
All right. I'll see you then."

00:04:00.968 --> 00:04:04.267
Telemarketers.

00:04:04.267 --> 00:04:05.567
[Normally]
Or you might also remember

00:04:05.567 --> 00:04:07.834
Powell from her star turn
as one of the key witnesses

00:04:07.834 --> 00:04:10.367
in the January 6th hearing,
where she was asked about

00:04:10.367 --> 00:04:12.067
her conversations
with President Trump

00:04:12.067 --> 00:04:13.400
in the run up
to the coup attempt.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.801
-In fact, you did
Get to see the president

00:04:14.801 --> 00:04:16.834
without an appointment.
-We did.

00:04:16.834 --> 00:04:19.067
-In the short period of time
that you had with the president,

00:04:19.067 --> 00:04:22.434
did he seem receptive
to the presentation

00:04:22.434 --> 00:04:24.567
that you were making?

00:04:39.033 --> 00:04:41.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.801 --> 00:04:44.133
-God bless the video editor
who decided to leave

00:04:44.133 --> 00:04:48.200
in that long beat of Powell
downing her Diet Dr. Pepper.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.567
Nothing tells you that a person
is out of the mind

00:04:50.567 --> 00:04:53.634
faster than seeing them
chug a Diet Dr. Pepper.

00:04:53.634 --> 00:04:56.601
I don't even know where to find
Diet Dr. Pepper.

00:04:56.601 --> 00:04:58.300
I think you have to buy
a soda machine

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:03.767
from an antiques dealer and pry
the back off with a crowbar.

00:05:03.767 --> 00:05:05.300
You know, when that tape
first surfaced,

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:06.801
we had our fun
making jokes about

00:05:06.801 --> 00:05:08.567
Diet Dr. Pepper
being a terrible soda.

00:05:08.567 --> 00:05:10.267
But I never tried it.

00:05:10.267 --> 00:05:14.167
And I want to let everyone know
that since then, I had one.

00:05:14.167 --> 00:05:16.534
One.

00:05:16.534 --> 00:05:18.000
Now, just as
a reminder of her role

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.267
in the attempt
to overturn the election,

00:05:19.267 --> 00:05:21.200
here's a quick recap
of some of the crazy [bleep]

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.667
she was saying at the time

00:05:22.667 --> 00:05:24.501
as a member of Donald Trump's
legal team.

00:05:24.501 --> 00:05:27.734
-It's been organized
and conducted

00:05:27.734 --> 00:05:29.767
with the help
of Silicon Valley people,

00:05:29.767 --> 00:05:33.000
the big tech companies,
the social media companies,

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.801
and even the media companies.

00:05:34.801 --> 00:05:37.133
What we are really
dealing with here

00:05:37.133 --> 00:05:39.767
and uncovering more
by the day,

00:05:39.767 --> 00:05:44.701
is the massive influence
of communist money

00:05:44.701 --> 00:05:46.067
through Venezuela,

00:05:46.067 --> 00:05:49.968
Cuba, and likely China
in the interference

00:05:49.968 --> 00:05:52.901
with our elections here
in the United States.

00:05:52.901 --> 00:05:56.300
-[As Powell] In fact, we can
prove Cuba and Venezuela

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:57.601
were involved in the election

00:05:57.601 --> 00:06:00.133
because their signs
were everywhere.

00:06:00.133 --> 00:06:02.968
[ Laughter ]

00:06:05.267 --> 00:06:08.501
Rudy, can you wipe
your face quieter?

00:06:13.467 --> 00:06:15.434
[Normally] I guess the better
question for Powell

00:06:15.434 --> 00:06:18.467
would have been who wasn't
involved in the conspiracy

00:06:18.467 --> 00:06:19.868
to steal the election.

00:06:19.868 --> 00:06:21.934
[As Powell] Big tech companies,
social media companies,

00:06:21.934 --> 00:06:24.801
home furnishing companies,
all the major sports leagues,

00:06:24.801 --> 00:06:27.701
the airlines, every steakhouse
in New York City,

00:06:27.701 --> 00:06:29.701
Chili's, both the country,

00:06:29.701 --> 00:06:34.634
the restaurant,
and the temperature,

00:06:34.634 --> 00:06:38.067
and all the major soda brands,
excluding Diet Dr. Pepper,

00:06:38.067 --> 00:06:40.601
because no one
in their right mind

00:06:40.601 --> 00:06:43.601
would consider
that monstrosity a soda.

00:06:47.667 --> 00:06:49.667
[Normally] In that same
interview

00:06:49.667 --> 00:06:50.968
with the January
6th Committee,

00:06:50.968 --> 00:06:53.067
Powell also confirmed
that Trump at one point

00:06:53.067 --> 00:06:55.901
tried to appoint her
special counsel

00:06:55.901 --> 00:06:57.701
to investigate
the 2020 election.

00:06:57.701 --> 00:07:02.767
-On Friday, he had asked me
to be special counsel

00:07:02.767 --> 00:07:07.167
to address the election issues.

00:07:27.901 --> 00:07:30.434
-Can you imagine this lunatic
with security clearance?

00:07:30.434 --> 00:07:34.434
I wouldn't clear her
for a Costco card.

00:07:34.434 --> 00:07:38.033
Oh, that's where she gets
the Diet Dr. Pepper.

00:07:38.033 --> 00:07:39.734
[As Powell] I buy it
by the pallet.

00:07:39.734 --> 00:07:41.267
[Normally] Anyway,
last week we found out

00:07:41.267 --> 00:07:43.167
that Powell had pleaded guilty
in the criminal case

00:07:43.167 --> 00:07:45.534
over Trump's attempt to overturn
the election results in Georgia.

00:07:45.534 --> 00:07:47.334
And then on Sunday,
Trump claimed

00:07:47.334 --> 00:07:50.901
he actually has nothing to do
with Sidney Powell.

00:07:50.901 --> 00:07:52.868
-Trump is responding
to two of his allies

00:07:52.868 --> 00:07:54.467
who flipped on him,
taking plea deals

00:07:54.467 --> 00:07:56.133
in the Georgia election
interference case.

00:07:56.133 --> 00:07:58.367
Trump tried to distance himself
from campaign lawyer

00:07:58.367 --> 00:08:00.834
Sidney Powell,
writing on Truth Social,

00:08:00.834 --> 00:08:04.033
"Ms. Powell was not my attorney
and never was."

00:08:04.033 --> 00:08:05.367
-[As Trump] And another thing,
I don't know

00:08:05.367 --> 00:08:07.067
who the hell
this Melania lady is.

00:08:07.067 --> 00:08:10.133
She was not and has
never been my wife.

00:08:10.133 --> 00:08:14.234
I mean, just look at us.
Do we look like a couple?

00:08:14.234 --> 00:08:15.601
Talk about chillies.

00:08:15.601 --> 00:08:16.934
[Normally] Obviously.

00:08:16.934 --> 00:08:19.367
They're -- [ Laughs ]

00:08:24.601 --> 00:08:27.400
I mean, not -- not today,
but years from now,

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.834
they'll look back and be like,
"Oh, that was good."

00:08:32.033 --> 00:08:34.100
Obviously, there are a couple
of problems with this claim.

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:35.634
First of all,
as we just told you,

00:08:35.634 --> 00:08:38.000
Powell and others confirmed
and sworn testimony

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.567
that she was in
the Oval Office with Trump,

00:08:40.567 --> 00:08:42.434
where he tried to name
her special counsel

00:08:42.434 --> 00:08:44.767
with security clearance to
investigate the 2020 election.

00:08:44.767 --> 00:08:46.300
Second, at that infamous
press conference,

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:48.133
Rudy told
the assembled media

00:08:48.133 --> 00:08:50.300
that Powell was part
of Trump's legal team.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.667
-Thank you very much for coming.

00:08:52.667 --> 00:08:57.033
This is a representative
of our legal team.

00:08:57.033 --> 00:08:59.767
We're representing
President Trump

00:08:59.767 --> 00:09:02.968
and we're representing
the Trump campaign.

00:09:02.968 --> 00:09:08.033
When I finish, Sidney Powell
and then --

00:09:08.033 --> 00:09:10.367
and then Jenna Ellis
will follow me.

00:09:10.367 --> 00:09:12.133
-Trump's only defense here
is that Rudy Giuliani

00:09:12.133 --> 00:09:13.968
is untrustworthy,
which is true.

00:09:13.968 --> 00:09:15.567
But then that applies
to everything,

00:09:15.567 --> 00:09:17.000
including the election
fraud claims.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.334
You can't have it both ways.

00:09:18.334 --> 00:09:20.033
[As Trump] That Rudy guy is out
of his [bleep] mind.

00:09:20.033 --> 00:09:21.367
You can't trust a word he says.

00:09:21.367 --> 00:09:25.767
Except on China and Hugo Chavez
teaming up with Dominion

00:09:25.767 --> 00:09:27.200
and Big Tech
to steal the election.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:29.000
It's weird because on that,
he's right on the money.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.467
Usually crazy.

00:09:31.467 --> 00:09:32.968
[Normally] And then, of course,
there's one more small problem

00:09:32.968 --> 00:09:34.701
with Trump's claim that Powell
was never his attorney.

00:09:34.701 --> 00:09:37.801
In November of 2020, Trump said
that Powell was his attorney.

00:09:37.801 --> 00:09:38.801
-The president wrote...

00:09:53.367 --> 00:09:55.234
-It's like Ocean's 11

00:09:55.234 --> 00:10:01.167
if they were trying to give
$160 million to a casino.

00:10:01.167 --> 00:10:04.100
[As Powell] Okay, Rudy, let's go
over the plan one more time.

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:05.834
Blackjack?
[As Giuliani] Always hit on 20.

00:10:05.834 --> 00:10:07.334
[As Powell] Roulette?

00:10:07.334 --> 00:10:08.567
[As Giuliani] Put it all
on yellow.

00:10:08.567 --> 00:10:11.601
[As Powell] Craps?
[As Giuliani] Eat the dice.

00:10:11.601 --> 00:10:12.968
[Normally] Fun fact --
most of that legal team

00:10:12.968 --> 00:10:14.033
has now been indicted.

00:10:14.033 --> 00:10:15.601
If you did
a where are they now,

00:10:15.601 --> 00:10:18.334
the answer for almost all of
them would be facing charges,

00:10:18.334 --> 00:10:20.300
except for Joseph diGenova,
who would be,

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.934
from the looks of him, getting
thrown off a JetBlue flight

00:10:22.934 --> 00:10:24.901
for trying to sneak in
his own marinara sauce.

00:10:24.901 --> 00:10:29.601
DiGenova used to be one of our
favorite Trump side characters

00:10:29.601 --> 00:10:31.000
because he looks
like the uncle

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.167
who complains about the portions
at a Staten Island wedding.

00:10:33.167 --> 00:10:34.534
"You know, for the price
this thing costs,

00:10:34.534 --> 00:10:36.868
you think they wouldn't
skimp on the prosciutto?"

00:10:40.133 --> 00:10:42.033
But hey,
maybe I'm not Joey diGenova.

00:10:44.434 --> 00:10:45.901
But he's not really around
anymore,

00:10:45.901 --> 00:10:47.634
which is good for the world,
but sad for us.

00:10:47.634 --> 00:10:48.934
But you know,
when I miss him,

00:10:48.934 --> 00:10:52.901
I can always just put on
an old episode of "NYPD Blue."

00:10:52.901 --> 00:10:54.234
Here's one more piece
of evidence

00:10:54.234 --> 00:10:56.200
that Powell has a direct
connection to Trump

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.567
and his attempts
to overturn the election --

00:10:57.567 --> 00:10:59.367
she said it herself
in an interview

00:10:59.367 --> 00:11:01.501
with an Australian news program
two years ago.

00:11:01.501 --> 00:11:06.868
-How did you come to be involved
in the election effort,

00:11:06.868 --> 00:11:08.300
post the election?

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:10.100
-I wish I knew. [ Laughs ]

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:15.501
It was like this huge tsunami
hit us.

00:11:15.501 --> 00:11:22.968
I was in the area at the time.
I had worked with Mr. Giuliani

00:11:22.968 --> 00:11:26.467
for a few days
before on another matter,

00:11:26.467 --> 00:11:31.167
and the next thing I know,
I'm smack in the middle of it.

00:11:31.167 --> 00:11:32.667
-Did you already have
a relationship

00:11:32.667 --> 00:11:34.100
with President Trump?

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:36.767
-Yes, I did have a relationship
with President Trump.

00:11:36.767 --> 00:11:39.901
-What was your relationship
with Trump? Did he trust you?

00:11:39.901 --> 00:11:41.300
-I believe he did trust me.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.667
-And had you been much
in the Oval Office?

00:11:44.667 --> 00:11:46.634
-Yes, I'd been there
a number of times.

00:11:46.634 --> 00:11:48.801
-I like how she was
just in the area

00:11:48.801 --> 00:11:51.067
and then ended up
in the Oval Office

00:11:51.067 --> 00:11:52.400
with the president
of the United States,

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:56.400
like she broke off from
her tour group to answer a text.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.467
"Hey, has anyone
seen Aunt Sidney?"

00:11:58.467 --> 00:12:02.934
"Yeah, she was pulled away by
a gnome whose head was leaking."

00:12:02.934 --> 00:12:07.467
"Should we tell the police?"
"No?"

00:12:07.467 --> 00:12:09.601
Trump thinks that just because
he never pays his lawyers,

00:12:09.601 --> 00:12:10.767
that means they weren't
his lawyers,

00:12:10.767 --> 00:12:12.033
but sadly, they were.

00:12:12.033 --> 00:12:13.467
They were his accomplices,
with direct knowledge

00:12:13.467 --> 00:12:15.667
of his criminal scheme
to dismantle American democracy.

00:12:15.667 --> 00:12:17.801
And now, they've pleaded guilty

00:12:17.801 --> 00:12:19.434
and agreed to cooperate
with prosecutors.

00:12:19.434 --> 00:12:21.300
It doesn't matter
if they're Harvard educated,

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.634
white collar lawyers
or weirdos who drink

00:12:23.634 --> 00:12:28.501
Diet Dr. Pepper, not by the can,
but by the tsunami.

00:12:31.167 --> 00:12:33.133
This has been A Closer Look.

